# The JDK this repository builds and releases with, the one the rest of the family is gated on (#13); `sdk env`
# sets the shell to it, and the pre-commit hook runs Gradle on it (#1). The workflows set up exactly this build and
# check that they did: javac's --release keeps the class files independent of the patch level, but the javadoc
# tool is not, so a release is rebuilt bit for bit only on the same JDK. A later patch release is taken on
# deliberately, in a pull request of its own, here and in the java-version of the workflows (RL-117).
java=25.0.4-tem
